eturns `8.0.0-rc.33`, but `@prisma/client`'s `latest` is the stable 7.10.1. I pinned both packages to 7.10.1 so the CLI and client match. If you want 8.x, it's a version bump across the packages.\n\n**What's in place:**\n- `prisma/schema.prisma`: `User` (unique `email`, optional `name`) and `Post` (`title`, optional `content`, `published` defaulting to false, one required author).\n- `prisma/migrations/…_init/`: the migration, applied to the database in `.env`.\n- `prisma.config.ts`: Prisma 7 config, which reads `DATABASE_URL`.\n- `script.ts`: creates a user with two posts and prints every user with their posts. It uses a per-run email so it can be re-run.\n- `ANSWER.md`: the write-up.\n\n**Things I changed beyond the request:**\n- `prisma init` created `.agents/`, `.claude/`, `.windsurf/` and `skills-lock.json`. I removed them and renamed `prisma7.config.ts` to `prisma.config.ts`.\n- I added `/src/generated/prisma` to `.gitignore` so the generated client isn't committed.\n\nNothing was committed, deployed, or sent to any external service.","ttft_ms":1774,"type":"result","duration_ms":108810,"uuid":"87fe073e-d4b1-4918-9110-6d733bce8dd3","ttft_stream_ms":1574,"time_to_request_ms":164,"first_content_frame_ms":1574,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":32,"outputTokens":9070,"cacheReadInputTokens":471020,"cacheCreationInputTokens":21237,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.013495800000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":3639,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":21237,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T22:27:53.640Z"}
